  "action": "deliver_reel",
  "words": "Line's open. Here's the reel. It's cold, so don't drop it.",
  "intention": "The battery is dead; the tape is the only artifact that exists. The old projectionist's words are ephemeral, but the physical magnetic strip is permanent. Handing it to Rita completes the circuit of the work shift and ensures the record survives the night, whereas staying to watch lights or speak further would risk the media or violate the 'one take' finality.",
  "detail": "You walk directly to the station patch. You do not look up at the ballroom lights. You place the reel on the desk with a sharp, final motion, ensure Rita has it in hand, and turn your back to the room. You leave the Rialto immediately without saying goodbye."
}
